  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#relevant-mutations should include the `referrerpolicy` attribute, since it changes how the image is fetched. I think like `crossorigin`, it should say when the *state* changes. (Enumerated attributes' values are ASCII case-insensitive, and sometimes several keywords map to the same state.)\r\n\r\ncc @domfarolino @rwlbuis\r\n\r\n(Related: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4533)",
